Z||000000||GT Bastard||01-17-2001||08:28 PM||||I actually had a dream that I can remember last night!  I think I had this dream because I was reading the responses to my post about compression ratio's in the tech forum. Here goes: Fierogod(Brad) and I wanted to drive down to Georgia and meet up with 1FST2M6 and give him some sort of part for his car(don't remember what it was.)  I don't remember travelling in the dream, but we got a call from Travis saying to meet him at the shop(We assumed Engineered Performance.)  Funny thing is, we ended up meeting him at a toy store.  He was really hyperactive and I asked him what we were doing here.  Trav said that the toy store sold some sort of device that you placed in your trunk.  This device was supposed to amplify the sound of your exhaust.  He and Brad end up picking them up and taking them to the cashier.  I was like, "Wait up!  I want something too."  So instead of buying one of those devices, I buy a Luke Skywalker figurine(I dunno why.)  I also remember Trav buying a bunch of gum in those cheesy plastic containers shaped like radio's.  So then I'm like: "Hey Travis, can we see you GT?"  He pulls it out of his pocket! It's a Hot Wheels car painted orange.  Brad and I start asking what the hell happened to the GT, and he says he traded it for this Hot Wheels car.   I was thinking: "Man that wasn't a good deal at all."  I don't remember what happened after that, but it all took place in some kind of Lego-Land.  That's all...||||reg||11
