Z||000010||sqoach||01-18-2001||12:33 AM||||i too, stimpy, have had bad dreams about my car. it was scary too. in one of them, my car just burst into flames. i was just standing there watching it. i somehow put out the fire and drove it home. i don't see how i drove it though. the other one, my car was filled with some kind of chemicals in the trunk. i don't know why they were in there either. newayz, i was opening the trunk, and the battery cables came off the battery and starting sparking. this caught the chemical crap on fire and then a huge explosion. i woke up right then. it was weird and scary.<BR>haven't had a good dream about my fiero yet  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>------------------<BR>sQoaCh<BR>sqoach@yahoo.com<BR>        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mysig_2.JPG"> ||||reg||1
